<title>USA: DePere, Wis., $1.025 mln won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>DePere, Wis., $1.025 mln won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc. said it won $1.025 million of DePere, Wis., general obligation promissory notes. with a true interest cost of 4.765 percent.</p>
</text>
